# ==============================================================================
# REST Client Interactive Workflows - Real-Time Fraud & AML Screening Rail
# ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8010
@sanctionsUrl = http://localhost:8015
@contentType = application/json

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. System Health & Telemetry Probes
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Liveness Probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### 1.2 Readiness Probe (PostgreSQL, Redis, RabbitMQ)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### 1.3 Prometheus Telemetry Exposition
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics


# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Happy Path Screening Workflow (Low Risk -> Auto Approved)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Step A: Ingest Payment Transaction (HTTP 202 Accepted)
# @name createScreening
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/screenings
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
X-Request-ID: req-audit-{{$guid}}

{
  "transaction_id": "tx-corp-{{$datetime iso8601}}",
  "account_id": "acct-us-99214",
  "amount": 250.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "client_ip": "192.168.1.100",
  "entity_name": "Acme Global Supplies LLC",
  "velocity_5m_count": 1
}

### Step B: Immediate In-Flight Inspection (FinTech In-Flight Visibility: HTTP 200 OK, status="processing")
@screeningId = {{createScreening.response.body.id}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/screenings/{{screeningId}}

### Step C: Poll Final Evaluation Status (Transitions to "approved", risk_score <= 15)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/screenings/{{screeningId}}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Sanctions Watchlist Hit Workflow (OFAC SDN Match -> Blocked)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Step A: Ingest Sanctioned Entity
# @name createSanctionedScreening
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/screenings
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "transaction_id": "tx-sanction-{{$datetime iso8601}}",
  "account_id": "acct-ru-88123",
  "amount": 75000.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "client_ip": "203.0.113.45",
  "entity_name": "Vladimir Rostov",
  "velocity_5m_count": 4
}

### Step B: Poll Sanction Screening Result (Transitions to "blocked", risk_score >= 95)
@sanctionedId = {{createSanctionedScreening.response.body.id}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/screenings/{{sanctionedId}}


# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. Chaos Engineering: Watchlist Degradation & Fallback (Result Envelope)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Step A: Inject 100% Timeout Failure into Partner Sanctions API
POST {{sanctionsUrl}}/api/v1/simulate/mode
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "mode": "timeout",
  "latency_seconds": 2.5
}

### Step B: Ingest Screening during Partner Outage
# @name createDegradedScreening
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/screenings
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "transaction_id": "tx-chaos-{{$datetime iso8601}}",
  "account_id": "acct-eu-11223",
  "amount": 12500.00,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "client_ip": "198.51.100.22",
  "entity_name": "Nordic Trade AB",
  "velocity_5m_count": 2
}

### Step C: Verify Graceful Degradation (status="flagged_review", fallback_score=40)
@degradedId = {{createDegradedScreening.response.body.id}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/screenings/{{degradedId}}

### Step D: Reset Partner Sanctions API to Normal Operation
POST {{sanctionsUrl}}/api/v1/simulate/reset


